     "body": "<p>This appears to be an upstream issue from what I can tell:<br/>\n<a href=\"https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/MJAVADOC-427\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/MJAVADOC-427</a></p>\n\n<p>We're on 2.10.3 of the javadoc-plugin: <a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo-build-tools/blob/master/pom.xml#L68-L69\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo-build-tools/blob/master/pom.xml#L68-L69</a></p>\n\n<p>More here:<br/>\n<a href=\"http://stackoverflow.com/questions/22756850/java-8-javadoc-tool-differences-and-bug-with-gradle-how-to-work-around-it\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://stackoverflow.com/questions/22756850/java-8-javadoc-tool-differences-and-bug-with-gradle-how-to-work-around-it</a></p>",
