     },
     "body": "<p>It appears that the issue here is actually simpler, the <tt>fcrepo-import-export-common</tt> module has a <tt>test</tt> directory, with no tests... hence the ERROR message.<br/>\nThis ERROR will certainly go away when the module refactoring has been completed.<br/>\nClosing ticket as <tt>Won't Fix</tt></p>",
